ra-related feature. </p> <h2>4. Photos and Videos</h2> <p> If you choose to capture, upload, save, or share photos or videos, FunChat may process that content to provide the requested functionality. </p> <p> Photos and videos may contain personal information, including images of people, locations, or other information visible in the content. You should only share content that you have the right to share. </p> <h2>5. Snapchat and Camera Kit</h2> <p> FunChat may use Snap Inc.'s Camera Kit and related Snapchat developer technologies to provide augmented reality camera effects and related functionality. </p> <p> When you choose to use a Snapchat-related sharing or integration feature, information or content may be processed as necessary to provide that feature and according to the applicable Snapchat terms and privacy practices. </p> <p> FunChat does not claim ownership of photos, videos, or other content that you create or share through the application. </p> <h2>6. How We Use Information</h2> <p> Information may be used to: </p> <ul> <li>Provide and operate FunChat features.</li> <li>Enable messaging and content-sharing functionality.</li> <li>Provide camera and AR effects.</li> <li>Maintain the security and reliability of the application.</li> <li>Respond to support requests.</li> <li>Improve the application and user experience.</li> </ul> <h2>7. Sharing of Information</h2> <p> We do not sell users' personal information. </p> <p> Information may be shared with service providers or technology partners when reasonably necessary to operate FunChat, provide requested features, maintain security, or comply with applicable law. </p> <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2> <p> FunChat may use third-party services to provide functionality such as camera effects, authentication, hosting, analytics, security, or content delivery. </p> <p> Third-party services may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable terms. </p> <h2>9. Data Security</h2> <p> We take reasonable measures designed to protect information handled by FunChat from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or disclosure. </p> <p> However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure. </p> <h2>10. Data Retention and Deletion</h2> <p> We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide the requested services, maintain security, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. </p> <p> Where applicable, users may request deletion of their account or personal information by contacting us using the contact information provided below. </p> <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2> <p> FunChat is not specifically directed to children under 13 in the United States. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 without appropriate authorization where required by law. </p> <p> If you believe that a child has provided personal information to us in a manner that violates applicable law, please contact us so that we can review and take appropriate action. </p> <h2>12. Your Choices and Rights</h2> <p> Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict certain processing of your information. </p> <p> You may also control certain device permissions, such as camera and photo access, through your device settings. </p> <h2>13. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2> <p> We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When changes are made, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. </p> <h2>14. Contact Us</h2> <p> If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or FunChat's privacy practices, please contact the FunChat developer. </p> <p> <strong>Application:</strong> FunChat </p> <h2>15. Additional Information</h2> <p> By using FunChat, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy. </p